Modifications and additions in this distribution (2026):
 - 4-node distributed deployment topology (3 Windows hosts + 1 Linux NIDS sensor)
 - Cross-host firewall automation
 - Sysmon endpoint telemetry across all Windows hosts (SwiftOnSecurity config)
 - Linux NIDS sensor (Suricata + Zeek) running in WSL2 Ubuntu
 - Custom Wazuh detection rules
 - Custom Cortex analyzer
 - Custom Shuffle SOAR playbooks
 - Custom Grafana dashboards
 - Atomic Red Team validation suite
 - Benchmark report on CPU-only hardware